  "description": "Listed building consent for the retention of the following internal works:New balusters to the right of the staircase (matching previously consented balusters to the left of the staircase) and a cast iron brace to the existing stairs which replicates a similar arrangement at 27 Fournier Street A modest new opening between the basement rooms Retention of a glazed and timber screen and doors in the basement rear room Removal of a non-original door in the basement WC The replacement of the York stone flooring in the basement rooms with a new limecrete sub base and reclaimed antique York stone floor Replacement of the modern fire surround in the basement front room with a new timber fireplace surround of traditional design and high quality and removal of modern doors",
